All listed checks passed on the frozen 0.10 own Zero compiler seed, SHA256
911f6d67361300755c13bbf5f3d231d54ceae5736f1ec5e60dde5d6e4095ed3a.
This isolates the language changes while the shared compiler is extended
separately. Final integrated OS/packaged-tool checks belong to the root release.

127 native Linux behavior checks: 85 existing plus 42 text extension cases.
42 actual native guest app64 pipeline/behavior checks; frontend, packer,
Zero compilation and resulting program all execute as native ZEROAPP1 code.
13 Windows native PE program cases executed under Wine, not native Windows.
528 frontend capacity/structure/malformed-input checks.
