The shared native app64 adapter's 13 existing checks passed as well.

Production sources are listed in sources.ztext. Frontend47865 bytes;
runtime36997 bytes; 64 runtime variables including prefix. Guest frontend
app32 is105720 bytes and app64 is71812, both below the131072-byte bundle slot.
No kernel, bootloader, compiler seed or release package was edited here.

lines(text): LF/CRLF split; bare CR preserved; empty input=>[]; blank/trailing
lines retained; one-based result; maximum2048 result items.
join(list|separator): strict text items and separator, empty list=>empty text;
no2048-item input bound beyond existing managed-heap capacity.
New keywords lines/join are reserved and need optional quotes as literal words.
Both operations are host-independent; host file APIs retain their old limits.

Root owns the four-mode QEMU full-OS validation. The separate text VM fixture
was not launched to avoid duplicate four-mode runs. This historical component
report does not claim a full-OS VM execution. The old external orchestration
files are not part of the current product source.
